---
description: Receipt-only proof package and public verifier boundary
globs: packages/proof/**,apps/witnessops-web/src/app/api/verify/**,apps/witnessops-web/src/app/verify/**,apps/witnessops-web/src/app/pl/verify/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep `packages/proof` on the receipt-only lane. Do not widen it into canonical bundle or corpus verification unless a separate lane authorizes that work.
- `/verify` and `/api/verify` accept untrusted input. Invalid, incomplete, ambiguous, or malformed input must not be presented as verified.
- The public verifier does not issue, sign, mutate, backfill, or store receipts.
- App import, storage, and report-sharing paths do not widen verifier inputs or confer new proof authority.
- Preserve original source evidence, material unknowns, and synthetic labels.
- After proof or verify edits, `pnpm --filter @witnessops/proof test` is the focused check. `pnpm optimize:quick-check` is the fast regression. Release-quality evidence is still `pnpm health` on Node 22.
